## What “Forge” Means in This Repo

**Product vision:** Tenants upload data, train/adapt models, evaluate, approve, deploy — the seven-stage MDC.

**What actually ships today:** The **ZIE (Zero-Inference-Extraction) flywheel** — every production inference call is a data-collection opportunity. A small local model races a large remote model; when the remote wins, the pair becomes training data for a **LoRA fine-tune on our base model** (`liquid/lfm-2.5-1.2b`), then gets promoted to the **fast path** via `zie_router_policies`.

Classic Forge routes (`/api/forge/*`) and Kairos `rag_adaptation` jobs are ** scaffolding for the original MDC** — not the path that accumulated legal draft pairs in June 2026.

