## Vault Tables (ZIE — **LIVE** on Render/Railway)

| Table | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| `zie_training_records` | **SFT** — `(prompt_json, remote_response_json, quality_score, task_type, domain, source_kind)` |
| `zie_preference_pairs` | **DPO** — `chosen_response_json` vs `rejected_response_json`; judge columns from migration 0007 |
| `zie_router_policies` | **Deployment payoff** — `fast_model_id` per `task_type` (migration `0004b_zie_router_policies.sql`) |
| `evaluation_runs` / `evaluation_metrics` | Judge bridge — `judge_run_id` on pairs |

Key columns for training dispatch:
- `used_for_sft` / `used_for_dpo` — set true when consumed by Modal job (volume trigger path)
- `judge_verified` — required for **verified-DPO** trigger (quality path)

Drizzle file `zieRouterPolicies.ts` (`local_model` / `remote_model`) **diverges** from live SQL (`fast_model_id`, etc.). Runtime code uses **`fast_*` columns** — trust migration `0004b`, not stale Drizzle shape.

