## Classic Forge MDC — **VISION** (target product)

Tenants: workspace → dataset → version → job → eval → registry → approve → deploy.

### API Routes (`/api/forge/` — code **PARTIAL**, DB **VISION**)

```
GET/POST /forge/workspaces
GET/POST /forge/workspaces/:wid/datasets[...]
GET/POST /forge/workspaces/:wid/jobs[...]
POST     /forge/workspaces/:wid/jobs/:jid/submit
POST     /forge/workspaces/:wid/jobs/:jid/dispatch    → Kairos (not double-dip)
GET      /forge/workspaces/:wid/jobs/:jid/events      → SSE
POST     /forge/workspaces/:wid/jobs/:jid/deploy
GET      /forge/workspaces/:wid/jobs/:jid/eval
GET/PUT  /forge/workspaces/:wid/policies
GET/POST /forge/workspaces/:wid/registry[...]/approve
GET      /forge/workspaces/:wid/deployments
```

Auth: `requireWorkspaceMember` — `wid → model_workspaces.tenant_id → tenants.user_id`.

### Training job state machine (target)

```
draft → queued → running → completed → deployed
                         ↘ failed
```

**Live gap:** `jobMonitor.ts` on Kairos `done` inserts **stub** eval (`overall_score=0.85`) — not the ZIE judge path.

### Training modes (target vs reality)

| Mode | Target | Reality |
|------|--------|---------|
| `prompt_tuning` | Better system prompt from dataset | **FICTION** — no branch in `forge.ts` |
| `rag_adaptation` | Build retrieval index (FAISS) | **FICTION** — label in Kairos goal string only; no index |
| `fine_tuning` | GPU weight update | **PARTIAL** — ZIE uses Modal LoRA on 1.2B, not Forge dataset pipeline |

### Governance (`model_policies`) — **VISION**

`allowed_base_models`, `max_dataset_bytes`, `max_concurrent_jobs`, `deployment_requires_approval`, `budget_limit_usd` — enforced at submit when tables exist.

