`POST /api/onboarding/provision` seeds workspace, CUAD dataset, completed `rag_adaptation` job, registry, `/extract-clause` deployment.

**Audit:** Seed may fail (column mismatches); Forge tables absent on prod; **`/extract-clause` is a static route in `legal.ts`**, not a `deployment_endpoints` row. FAISS claims in hyperparams are **documentation only**.

